#: ../../language/error_codes/E0081.md:1
msgid "E0081"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0081.md:3
msgid "Warning name: `regex_match_missing_after`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0081.md:5
msgid ""
"A `lexmatch` pattern can leave an unmatched input suffix, but the pattern"
" does not bind or explicitly ignore that suffix."
msgstr "`lexmatch` 模式可能会留下未匹配的输入后缀，但该模式既未绑定也未显式忽略这个后缀。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0081.md:8
msgid ""
"Add `$` when the match must end with the input, or add `after=` to bind "
"or ignore the remaining suffix."
msgstr "当匹配必须在输入末尾结束时添加 `$`；否则添加 `after=` 以绑定或忽略剩余后缀。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0081.md:11
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0081.md:13
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn starts_with_digits(input : String) -> Bool {\n"
"  lexmatch input {\n"
"    re\"^[0-9]+\" => true\n"
"    _ => false\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0081.md:17
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0081.md:19
msgid ""
"Anchor the regex at the end, or make the suffix explicit with "
"`after=suffix` or `after=_`."
msgstr "将正则锚定在结尾，或使用 `after=suffix` 或 `after=_` 显式处理后缀。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0081.md:22
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn starts_with_digits(input : String) -> Bool {\n"
"  lexmatch input {\n"
"    (re\"^[0-9]+\", after=_) => true\n"
"    _ => false\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
